"""Episode 19 (Year 1825) polygons, used by world_data_1825.
1812 -> 1825: Napoleon falls (1814/1815), Congress of Vienna: France back to its old borders, United Kingdom of the Netherlands
(with Belgium), Prussia with the Rhineland, Westphalia, Posen and northern Saxony, Austria with Lombardy-Venetia and Illyria,
Russia with Congress Poland, Norway in union with Sweden (1814), the Papal States, Tuscany, Two Sicilies and Piedmont-Sardinia
restored, Java and Suriname back to the Dutch; Egypt conquers Sennar (1821); Russia takes Dagestan and northern Azerbaijan (1813).
Latin America: United Provinces (1816), Chile (1818), Gran Colombia (1819/1822), Peru (1821), Mexico (1821, with Chiapas 1824),
Central America (1823), Empire of Brazil (1822, with Cisplatina), Paraguay (1811), Bolivia (1825, with the Atacama coast), Haiti
rules all of Hispaniola (1822-44); Spain keeps Cuba, Puerto Rico, the Philippines and Chiloe (until Jan 1826).
US with Florida (1819/1821). British Sydney grows (Bathurst 1815, Port Macquarie 1821, Moreton Bay 1824), Singapore (1819)."""
